# {{label|en|computing|informal|humorous}} A method of [[transfer]]ring a [[computer]] [[file]] from one computer to another by copying it to a [[floppy disk]] or some other external storage, carrying the disk to the other computer and [[install]]ing it there, in contrast with [[electronic]] methods used by [[networked]] computers to transfer data.

